    - rid: 1000
      type: {class: BtRoot, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: f2dc60b15dd34664bfb127ec85e7eb7e
        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'Peekaboo: vanish behind full cover out of the target''s sight, wait in silence, then dart out a step to the side, head snapping round, strike and duck back before it can answer. Three times from one hiding place, never from quite the same spot, then on to another.'
